research/audit/wave7-dispatch/certifier-fs-nested-intervals-implies-lub.log-3335-[L4] $K$ is not Archimedean, since $n \cdot 1_K < t$ for every natural $n$ ([[lem-laurent-non-archimedean]], [[def-archimedean-field]]).
research/audit/wave7-dispatch/certifier-fs-nested-intervals-implies-lub.log-3336-
