research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-beta-real-analysis-completeness-limits.log-32266-- **The companion failure** is [[fs-cauchy-complete-implies-lub]], refuted by the
research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-beta-real-analysis-completeness-limits.log-32267-  same field. Together they are the exact content of the Archimedean hypotheses
research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-beta-real-analysis-completeness-limits.log:32268:  in clauses 2 and 4 of [[thm-completeness-equivalences]].
